gs dragons  and even a bit of incest for you Game of  Thrones fans out there the story of  Beren and lúthien is one of tokens most  well known works outside of Lord of the  Rings and it's a story about the  forbidden love between a man named Baron  and a royal elf named lúthien in order  to marry lúthien Baron is tasked with  retrieving the crown of Morgoth sour ons  old master the story follows his  impossible task and we see elements that  we are not used to such as werewolves  and vampires  and lastly the story of Aragorn  Aragorn is undoubtedly one of the fan  favorites but when we meet him in a  Fellowship of the Ring  he's already well into his 80s and not  much is mentioned about his prior life a  story following young Aragorn  as he grows and becomes the man we've  all come to expect would please many  fans and the story could even include  other favorites such as Gandalf and  Legolas but I feel like this is the  least likely of all the options we've  discussed today as this story is a bit  too similar to the Fellowship of the  Ring despite the direction Amazon decide  to take the franchise in it is  guaranteed to have a hefty budget and  they do genuinely seem to care about the  project we can only hope they don't  deviate too far from the books and treat  Tolkien's work with the respect it  deserves  what about you guys what timelines and  stories would you like to see and does  the prospect of a lautering  TV show even excite you
 

